flowchart TB
    accTitle: When a search asks Paperless
    accDescr: As a page of Nextcloud loads, its search asks the app whether Paperless is a connected service for the user who signed in. While an administrator includes Paperless in every search of every user, it is not, and every search asks Paperless. Otherwise, while the administrators let users choose, a user who selected Always search my Paperless documents in the personal settings has every search of their own ask Paperless. Everybody else finds Paperless documents only with the switch Search connected services, which Nextcloud turns off again on every page that loads.

    page["A page of Nextcloud loads, and its search<br>lists its providers for the user"]
    trusted{"Always include Paperless<br>in global search?"}
    allowed{"Let users include Paperless<br>in all their searches?"}
    chosen{"Did the user select<br>Always search my Paperless documents?"}
    always(["`**Every search asks Paperless**
    without the switch`"])
    switch(["`**Paperless only with the switch**
    Search connected services,
    off again on every page that loads`"])

    page --> trusted
    trusted -- "yes, for every user" --> always
    trusted -- "no" --> allowed
    allowed -- "yes" --> chosen
    allowed -- "no" --> switch
    chosen -- "yes, for this user" --> always
    chosen -- "no" --> switch

    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef app fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef yes fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class page person
    class trusted,allowed,chosen app
    class always yes
